{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>今日（21日）早上9時48分，石澳道石澳郊野公園對開，有七人車與的士迎頭相撞，兩人受傷，其中私家車司機手受傷，由救護員在場包紮治理。</p><p>運輸署宣佈，因交通意外，石澳道（來回方向）近爛泥灣的全線現已封閉，現時上址交通繁忙。</p><figure><img alt=\"石澳道近石澳郊野公園對開，一輛七人車與的士迎頭相撞。（讀者提供）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261121/1200757954199162880681937.jpeg/7Pa6W9tDlnNkbXFJspdrtDlALfbBYOtCugGwwroBsMI\"/><figcaption>石澳道近石澳郊野公園對開，一輛七人車與的士迎頭相撞。（讀者提供）</figcaption></figure><p>現場可見，兩車車頭均嚴重受損，碎片散落一地；其中的士現漏油。</p><figure><img alt=\"兩車車頭均嚴重受損，碎片散落一地；其中的士現漏油。（讀者提供）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261121/1200757951682449408480269.jpeg/kxXEFvjoSs1VklAGhpUe2pHimMRsNdmAi7z_EYu8_xE\"/><figcaption>兩車車頭均嚴重受損，碎片散落一地；其中的士現漏油。（讀者提供）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"兩車車頭均嚴重受損，碎片散落一地。（讀者提供）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261121/1200757948897300480380742.jpeg/lf0J_IhzQPemD2NmjoJE_Tvwyash_E8NQM6BKkDOgSo\"/><figcaption>兩車車頭均嚴重受損，碎片散落一地。（讀者提供）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"的士乘客等待救援。（讀者提供）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261121/1200758092166336512597381.jpeg/j6L5snWNxcbkKwyYYjFS38w_aAJ-hKViODX6gzg1-oM\"/><figcaption>的士乘客等待救援。（讀者提供）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-21T02:43:50.247434+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":245,"images":4,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-21T02:33:24+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-21T09:17:32.163755+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-21T02:37:23.137736+00:00","content_hash":"9f8545efd7cfb3b939c62b51091d158b8a5e24525a080bbfbe56678533350848","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}